1497:
The personnel officer shall:
(a) Recommend to appointing authorities, as appropriate, standards for training programs and programs for approval as meeting such standards;
(b) See that training is carried out as approved and have prepared certificates or other forms of recognition for persons who satisfactorily complete approved courses and programs;
